<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-ALL YIELDS FALL AT T-BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-ALL YIELDS FALL AT T-BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of all maturities</p>
<p>on Latvian T-bills fell at Wednesday's auction, the finance</p>
<p>ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct)  LAST   NO OF BANKS   ISSUE BID   SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.93	  4.49	 4	   0.5   1.25  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  4.86	  5.13	 4	   1.0   1.8   1.0</p>
<p> Six-month    5.67	  6.03	 7	   1.0   3.07  1.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
